Resin-cast display pieces for Loewe, prototyped for a perfume launching soon. Each flower casting encapsulates the actual ingredients of the fragrance, intended for physical retail and location-based display.

We designed and developed the process to produce these pieces at scale, for use across Loewe's retail experience.
